{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_ex01_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_ex01",
  "title": "聲東擊西",
  "storyCode": "RI-EX-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_ex01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c02c06f37a4e266d394b7cdb0ad4982b57e5a8eb8ffee277f76b7fd68c77a0f1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "烈日，荒野，黃沙，熱風！wohoo！新的歌曲在我的心中誕生了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（solo）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "你們兩個太吵了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "確實。難得有這麼空曠又無人的環境，不用擔心被追趕的事，就不能安靜地休息一會嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "不過，Alty，這裡也能聞到海的氣息，真的安全嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Aya，你真是一如既往的不解風情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "這片大地上沒有安全的地方，但我們總要學會給自己放鬆一下，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "或許你是對的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "所以下一步，我們要用什麼拓寬前進的道路？總不能再空手而歸了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "至少，這次那個醫生已經給了我們答案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Alty看了看手中的“鑰匙”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "真的嗎真的嗎？這個東西看上去可不普通，她居然願意把這個東西給你？你拿啥換的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "知識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "知識與這東西是等價的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我也不清楚，不過我覺得醫生她是在催促我們去運用這個知識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "她會不知道這些嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我們知道多少，她應該就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "......仔細想想，真正的交易內容，應該是用我們的好奇心換來了我們的行動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "這，她不是啥都沒出嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "被騙了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不，應該說是被誘導了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "被指揮了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "被指引了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "當真有這麼重要嗎，這個醫生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不重要。我覺得這個醫生正是想告訴我們，她的舉動並不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "重要的是我們怎麼想，怎麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "那鑰匙呢？我們要去嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "啊，很麻煩。能不能不去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我想這就和音樂一樣......我們不應該擁有一種可以強制改變別人的力量，我們只是唱自己的歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "唱給他們聽，如果好聽——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "那他們也會唱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（solo）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "哈，那就把更多的知識和鑰匙都交給準備好了的人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "會是誰呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "還不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "說不定還沒出生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "那太好了，但願他還沒出生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "別期待這種事情，Dan，我們......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "怎麼了，Alty。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "車沒能量了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "你沒有準備嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "準備了，但我們之前繞路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "而且，我必須承認，在這種沒有公路也沒有路標的荒野上行駛，很容易喪失方向感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "也就是說，我們迷路了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不能完全這麼說，在大方向上，我們並沒有偏離，只能說我們在開闢新的道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "迷路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "迷路！這也是個不錯的題材。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "不得不說，Dan，我有時候真想學學你的樂觀。那怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "那個方向好像有一片雨林，我們去那邊看看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "那，誰來推車？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "或許我們可以輪流來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Alty。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "幹什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "我們周邊已經聚集了不少人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "但我們聽不懂他們的語言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "所以就這樣讓他們跟著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "你有更好的方法嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "把他們全都解決掉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "如果你能說服Frost和Dan的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（彈唱）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "text": "&*......%￥......&（這、這是什麼聲音，為什麼會這麼好聽？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "text": "&%......%（我從沒聽過這樣的聲音......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "嗨，你們好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "你們說的是什麼語言啊，可以告訴我嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "啊，雖然你們說了我也不會知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
      "text": "......%&￥（這些人是哪裡來的？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人D",
      "text": "￥......&#（這傢伙怎麼長得這麼奇怪？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "好吧，至少這裡有人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "如果這裡有能讓我們補給的地方就更好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "我認為你在做夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你們是外鄉人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "嗯？你說的是薩爾貢語？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嗯，看來你們確實是外鄉人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你們為什麼來這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我們的車耗盡了能量，所以一路來到這裡想要找一些懂源石技藝的人幫我們補充一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......跟我來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "你看，Aya，這不是出現了希望嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "好吧，這片大地真是無奇不有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "喂喂喂，喂喂喂喂喂，怎麼回事，怎麼回事啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "在這樣一片原始的雨林裡，竟然有這樣一座村莊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（哼唱）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "確實令人吃驚，大部分的建築都有現代建築的影子，但也保留了原始的美感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "很古怪，但也很獨特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我是這個部族的族長，祖瑪瑪，我的部族的人大部分都能聽懂你們說的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我可以安排一些部族祭司給你們的交通工具補充能量，但是我有條件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "什麼樣的條件？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我想看一看你們的車的內部構造。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "......就這樣就可以嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "你確定你不會把我們的車搞壞嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "應該不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Alty？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我想我們並沒有多少選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "所以？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我們同意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "好。大祭司爺爺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "來了！......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "嗯嗯嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "你們是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "你是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "沒想到在這裡能遇到你這樣的存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "噢，不瞞你們說，我也是這麼想的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "不過比起你們，我還是對你們的車更加好奇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "請便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "我要重複一下剛才的話，這片大地真是無奇不有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我難得同意你的意見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這時，frost把吉他接上了祭祀用的音響，開始了一段即興獨奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不錯啊，Frost。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "這座奇特的村莊給了我靈感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "好帥啊，Frost，這次的旋律還加入了一些變化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "熾熱，壓抑......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "我把這段曲子，取名為......《D》！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "text": "哪裡來的聲音？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "text": "這是什麼聲音？我感覺我渾身都充滿了力量！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
      "text": "好像是剛才來的外鄉人！快去看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "人越來越多了，Alty......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不妙哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "這些生命在渴望音樂！渴望力量！渴望......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "text": "這個聲音是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
      "text": "外鄉人啊，請留下更多的聲音！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Alty......雖然很突然，不過我覺得現在的氛圍也很適合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "乾脆把我們的音響搬出來，一起上去演奏一曲吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "總之我不反對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "好啊好啊，可不能讓Frost一個人搶了風頭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "這麼勁爆的編曲，我不參一腳怎麼行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "那就讓這裡的人感受我們的AUS的音樂吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "text": "為什麼只是一些聲音，我卻興奮得停不下來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "text": "這難道和祭司們用的祭樂一樣，是所謂的“樂曲”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
      "text": "我從沒聽過這樣的樂曲！她們究竟是什麼人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人D",
      "text": "我知道了，她們一定是“奎卡亞提”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "“奎卡亞提”？這是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "噢，這是他們的語言中對“唱歌的人”的稱呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "這裡已經很久沒有出現過“奎卡亞提”了，你們的音樂征服了她們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "雖然我不得不說，你們的音樂和我過去聽過的奎卡亞提的音樂完全不一樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "但是沒有關係，我覺得你們的音樂更加有趣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人E",
      "text": "“奎卡亞提”，再給我們演奏一曲吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人F",
      "text": "你們想要什麼都可以，再來一曲吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "怎麼辦，Alty？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "留下來吧，Alty！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "雖然我想提醒你們不要忘記我們的目標......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不過，好吧，我們有的是時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "沒想到這裡還有信使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "我也沒想到只在雜誌上見過的AUS竟然會來到這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "祖瑪瑪呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "她在製造你們想要的音響，所以由我來給你帶路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "你們打算在這裡待多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "也許是一周，也許是一個月，也許是一年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "這裡點燃了我們，那我們至少要在這裡盡興才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "那麼這裡應該更加適合你們演出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "好酷的地方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "這裡是......某種神廟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "沒錯，這裡過去是所有部族聚集在一起舉辦“瑪維索提亞”的地方，不過自從嘉維爾離開後，已經很久沒有用過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "“瑪維索提亞”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "嘉維爾？我好像在羅德島上看過這個名字......算了，應該只是同名吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "你們可以在這裡進行你們的演出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "讓這裡的人享受最好的音樂吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "哈哈，沒錯，在這裡留下屬於AUS的痕跡吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩個月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "AUS真是一些不可思議的傢伙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "竟然就真的在這裡停留了兩個月。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "這下嘉維爾要是哪天回來的話恐怕會大吃一驚吧，這樣一個偏僻的地方，竟然也出現了音樂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "這裡的人竟然愛上了搖滾樂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "那麼，今天她們又打算帶來什麼樣的演出呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "......說不定最狂熱的是我自己也說不定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "AUS的各位......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房間是空的，各種生活用品和被褥也都擺放整齊，中央的簡易桌子上，放著一張紙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "難道她們離開了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "桌上的這封信，我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "“我們走了，勿念。願音樂能帶給你們歡樂。還有，我們把我們的唱片全都留在了這裡，盡情享受吧。——AUS”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "......呵，真是一群不可思議的傢伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我想我不會忘記這個叫做阿卡胡拉的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（哼唱）一次難忘的經歷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "但是這裡的人還是太吵了，而且太野蠻了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "是嗎？我很喜歡啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "你當然喜歡，我覺得把你留在那裡你也不會反對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "我確實猶豫了很久誒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "你們不覺得這裡的人擁有一種天然的、原始的活力嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "我們已經去過很多國家很多城市了，但是沒有一個地方的人是這樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "我喜歡他們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "好吧，這一點我確實無法否認。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "他們理解了我們的音樂，他們是最棒的聽眾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "看來Frost也很中意他們呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "可不該把別人的生活攪得天翻地覆。只要唱歌就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "唱給他們聽，如果好聽——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "那他們也會唱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "我們是不是說過一樣的話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "誰知道呢，我們或許說過無數次同樣的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "走吧，我們該繼續我們的旅途了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "把歌聲唱給這片大地，他會傾聽嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾個人在車上，開了個玩笑就結束了。\nAlty看著手中的鑰匙，凱爾希醫生啊，你們羅德島能給這片大地想要的答案嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
